Third-party datasets
--------------------
The lanes under brain/ evaluate against public datasets. They are fetched at
run time and never committed; each carries its own terms, which apply to any
use of the data and of results derived from it:

  LoCoMo              snap-research/locomo           CC BY-NC 4.0
  RepoBench-R         tianyang/repobench-r           CC BY-NC-ND 4.0
  MemoryAgentBench    ai-hyz/MemoryAgentBench        MIT
  LongMemEval         xiaowu0162/longmemeval         MIT

What this repository commits is its own side of each run: the code, the
prompts, and the predictions and scores it produced. brain/README.md describes
how each dataset is fetched.
